  "account": "文汇书香苑",
  "source_title": "茅以升\n他炸了自己造的桥，又用一辈子把它修回来，世界桥梁史上独一份 #茅以升 #国之脊梁 #读书感悟 #历史名人 #中国桥梁之父 #文字共鸣 \n#情感共鸣",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 335.528005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集我们说到毛蚁生花了九百二十五天，建成钱塘江大桥，通车才八十九天，就含泪亲自给炸了炸桥。当晚，他写下抗战必胜，此桥必复带着十四箱图纸撤到了后方。今天，茅以生系列第二集，我告诉你，这座桥的命比你想象的硬的多。你以为炸完就结束了？没有这座桥，前前后后被炸了四次，第一次是锚以生炸的。一九三七年十二月二十三日下午五点五，孔钢梁断裂，坠江，为的是不让日军过桥，可日本人占了桥之后，不甘心哪。这是连接护杭营铁路和浙赣铁路的关键通道。他们做梦都想用上。一九四零年，日本人先在坠江的废钢梁上搭木板，凑合让汽车过那桥走上去，晃晃悠悠跟走钢丝似的。到了一九四四年十月，好不容易把铁路修通，全是东拼西凑的活，公路桥到日军投降都没能修好。你以为这就完了？更狠的是，中国人自己抗战到了后期，中国的游击队员盯上了这座桥。你日本人不是想修吗？修好了，我就给你炸了。据记载，一支二十多人的爆破队带着五百多公斤爆破材料摸到萧山，雇了乡下的船工，夜里把船滑到桥墩底下装上定时爆破材料，人撤远了。在想一九四四年春天五号吨挨炸了一次，一九四五年年初六号吨又挨炸了一次。你想想那个画面月黑风高，小船划到桥墩，底下人在水下摸黑作业，头顶上就是日本人的岗哨，稍有不慎就是没命的事。茅以升炸桥是不能留给敌人，游击队长是你修好了也不让你用一座桥来回折腾日本人修一次，中国人炸一次，再修一次，再炸一次。到了一九四五年，抗战胜利，日本人投降了，你以为这座桥终于能安生了没有？第四次炸桥发生在一九四九年五月，杭州被解放的前夕，撤退的军队又对大乔动了手。好在地下党员和护桥工人拼死保护，只炸毁了部分铁轨。大桥主体保住了，你算算一九三七年毛以生诈一次，一九四四年游击队炸一次，一九四五年游击队再炸一次。一九四九年撤退，军队又炸一次，前前后后炸了四次。可你知道最神奇的是什么吗？炸了四次，这座桥的主体结构，愣是没垮，乔墩还在大部分钢粮还能用，就像一个打不死的硬汉，挨了四刀，站起来拍拍灰还能接着干。为什么这么结实？因为毛以生当年造桥的时候，是真材实料往里砸，每一根桩，每一个吨每一段钢梁都是按最高标准来建。他造的不是一座应付了事的桥，是一座能扛住战火的桥。杭州人，后来给这座桥起了个外号，叫乔坚强一座桥谁都拆不掉，他谁也没法真正拥有他。日本人想占站不住，中国人想炸炸不垮，战火烧了十几年，他依然横跨在钱塘江上，这就是中国桥的骨头。而这一切的起点是那个叫毛以生的人。他造桥的时候没想过这座桥会经历这么多磨难。但他知道，这座桥必须结示，因为他承载的不只是火车和汽车，是中国人的骨气。这座桥被炸了四次，还能站起来的故事就写在国之脊梁。这本书里，书里还有四十多位，像毛以生这样的国之脊梁，每一个人的故事都比小说还精彩。想要的朋友左下角点链接直接带走，但故事还没完，矛以身许下的此桥必复四个字，后来兑现了吗？下一集毛以生系列大结局，他回来了，带着十四箱图纸把这座炸了四次的桥修了回来。如果你也为这座桥坚强感到震撼，点个赞收藏起来，关注我大结局见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4570,
      "text": "上一集我们说到毛蚁生花了九百二十五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4970,
      "end_ms": 6730,
      "text": "建成钱塘江大桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7150,
      "end_ms": 8690,
      "text": "通车才八十九天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9290,
      "end_ms": 13170,
      "text": "就含泪亲自给炸了炸桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13190,
      "end_ms": 13590,
      "text": "当晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15580,
      "end_ms": 17700,
      "text": "他写下抗战必胜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17980,
      "end_ms": 22320,
      "text": "此桥必复带着十四箱图纸撤到了后方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22940,
      "end_ms": 23400,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23440,
      "end_ms": 25060,
      "text": "茅以生系列第二集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25280,
      "end_ms": 26140,
      "text": "我告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26520,
      "end_ms": 30520,
      "text": "这座桥的命比你想象的硬的多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00012",
      "start_ms": 31180,
      "end_ms": 33200,
      "text": "你以为炸完就结束了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33840,
      "end_ms": 35540,
      "text": "没有这座桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36060,
      "end_ms": 38600,
      "text": "前前后后被炸了四次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39480,
      "end_ms": 42900,
      "text": "第一次是锚以生炸的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43020,
      "end_ms": 46670,
      "text": "一九三七年十二月二十三日下午五点五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00017",
      "start_ms": 46750,
      "end_ms": 48190,
      "text": "孔钢梁断裂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48230,
      "end_ms": 48670,
      "text": "坠江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49330,
      "end_ms": 51110,
      "text": "为的是不让日军过桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51690,
      "end_ms": 53550,
      "text": "可日本人占了桥之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54310,
      "end_ms": 55290,
      "text": "不甘心哪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56310,
      "end_ms": 60935,
      "text": "这是连接护杭营铁路和浙赣铁路的关键通道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00023",
      "start_ms": 61490,
      "end_ms": 63345,
      "text": "他们做梦都想用上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64310,
      "end_ms": 65315,
      "text": "一九四零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65980,
      "end_ms": 69585,
      "text": "日本人先在坠江的废钢梁上搭木板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00026",
      "start_ms": 70190,
      "end_ms": 72920,
      "text": "凑合让汽车过那桥走上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00027",
      "start_ms": 72920,
      "end_ms": 75345,
      "text": "晃晃悠悠跟走钢丝似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75890,
      "end_ms": 77425,
      "text": "到了一九四四年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77890,
      "end_ms": 79735,
      "text": "好不容易把铁路修通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80190,
      "end_ms": 82190,
      "text": "全是东拼西凑的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82210,
      "end_ms": 85745,
      "text": "公路桥到日军投降都没能修好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00032",
      "start_ms": 86560,
      "end_ms": 87945,
      "text": "你以为这就完了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00033",
      "start_ms": 88660,
      "end_ms": 90070,
      "text": "更狠的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90070,
      "end_ms": 93705,
      "text": "中国人自己抗战到了后期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94670,
      "end_ms": 98035,
      "text": "中国的游击队员盯上了这座桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98700,
      "end_ms": 100325,
      "text": "你日本人不是想修吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00037",
      "start_ms": 101080,
      "end_ms": 101815,
      "text": "修好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102050,
      "end_ms": 102895,
      "text": "我就给你炸了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00039",
      "start_ms": 103920,
      "end_ms": 104565,
      "text": "据记载，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105430,
      "end_ms": 111785,
      "text": "一支二十多人的爆破队带着五百多公斤爆破材料摸到萧山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00041",
      "start_ms": 112740,
      "end_ms": 114145,
      "text": "雇了乡下的船工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00042",
      "start_ms": 114740,
      "end_ms": 120055,
      "text": "夜里把船滑到桥墩底下装上定时爆破材料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120630,
      "end_ms": 121845,
      "text": "人撤远了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122380,
      "end_ms": 128345,
      "text": "在想一九四四年春天五号吨挨炸了一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129220,
      "end_ms": 133225,
      "text": "一九四五年年初六号吨又挨炸了一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134180,
      "end_ms": 136795,
      "text": "你想想那个画面月黑风高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137290,
      "end_ms": 138470,
      "text": "小船划到桥墩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00048",
      "start_ms": 138470,
      "end_ms": 141085,
      "text": "底下人在水下摸黑作业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141600,
      "end_ms": 143505,
      "text": "头顶上就是日本人的岗哨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00050",
      "start_ms": 144110,
      "end_ms": 146525,
      "text": "稍有不慎就是没命的事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00051",
      "start_ms": 147160,
      "end_ms": 150045,
      "text": "茅以升炸桥是不能留给敌人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00052",
      "start_ms": 150520,
      "end_ms": 157795,
      "text": "游击队长是你修好了也不让你用一座桥来回折腾日本人修一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00053",
      "start_ms": 158090,
      "end_ms": 159265,
      "text": "中国人炸一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00054",
      "start_ms": 159610,
      "end_ms": 160470,
      "text": "再修一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00055",
      "start_ms": 160590,
      "end_ms": 161530,
      "text": "再炸一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00056",
      "start_ms": 161610,
      "end_ms": 162950,
      "text": "到了一九四五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00057",
      "start_ms": 162970,
      "end_ms": 163915,
      "text": "抗战胜利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00058",
      "start_ms": 164190,
      "end_ms": 165275,
      "text": "日本人投降了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165720,
      "end_ms": 168750,
      "text": "你以为这座桥终于能安生了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00060",
      "start_ms": 169230,
      "end_ms": 173225,
      "text": "第四次炸桥发生在一九四九年五月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173640,
      "end_ms": 175485,
      "text": "杭州被解放的前夕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176040,
      "end_ms": 178695,
      "text": "撤退的军队又对大乔动了手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179580,
      "end_ms": 182955,
      "text": "好在地下党员和护桥工人拼死保护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00064",
      "start_ms": 183650,
      "end_ms": 185385,
      "text": "只炸毁了部分铁轨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00065",
      "start_ms": 186190,
      "end_ms": 187835,
      "text": "大桥主体保住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00066",
      "start_ms": 189520,
      "end_ms": 194205,
      "text": "你算算一九三七年毛以生诈一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00067",
      "start_ms": 194720,
      "end_ms": 196955,
      "text": "一九四四年游击队炸一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00068",
      "start_ms": 197730,
      "end_ms": 200170,
      "text": "一九四五年游击队再炸一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200250,
      "end_ms": 201710,
      "text": "一九四九年撤退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00070",
      "start_ms": 201730,
      "end_ms": 203445,
      "text": "军队又炸一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00071",
      "start_ms": 203890,
      "end_ms": 206135,
      "text": "前前后后炸了四次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00072",
      "start_ms": 206670,
      "end_ms": 209005,
      "text": "可你知道最神奇的是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00073",
      "start_ms": 209450,
      "end_ms": 210315,
      "text": "炸了四次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00074",
      "start_ms": 210970,
      "end_ms": 212730,
      "text": "这座桥的主体结构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00075",
      "start_ms": 212970,
      "end_ms": 213965,
      "text": "愣是没垮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00076",
      "start_ms": 214440,
      "end_ms": 217305,
      "text": "乔墩还在大部分钢粮还能用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00077",
      "start_ms": 218140,
      "end_ms": 220035,
      "text": "就像一个打不死的硬汉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00078",
      "start_ms": 220320,
      "end_ms": 221060,
      "text": "挨了四刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221240,
      "end_ms": 223695,
      "text": "站起来拍拍灰还能接着干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00080",
      "start_ms": 224720,
      "end_ms": 226015,
      "text": "为什么这么结实？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00081",
      "start_ms": 226950,
      "end_ms": 229635,
      "text": "因为毛以生当年造桥的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00082",
      "start_ms": 230060,
      "end_ms": 232255,
      "text": "是真材实料往里砸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00083",
      "start_ms": 233250,
      "end_ms": 234155,
      "text": "每一根桩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00084",
      "start_ms": 234580,
      "end_ms": 239375,
      "text": "每一个吨每一段钢梁都是按最高标准来建。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00085",
      "start_ms": 239690,
      "end_ms": 242475,
      "text": "他造的不是一座应付了事的桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242980,
      "end_ms": 245865,
      "text": "是一座能扛住战火的桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00087",
      "start_ms": 246830,
      "end_ms": 247470,
      "text": "杭州人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00088",
      "start_ms": 247470,
      "end_ms": 249515,
      "text": "后来给这座桥起了个外号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00089",
      "start_ms": 249960,
      "end_ms": 254330,
      "text": "叫乔坚强一座桥谁都拆不掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00090",
      "start_ms": 254330,
      "end_ms": 256995,
      "text": "他谁也没法真正拥有他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00091",
      "start_ms": 257480,
      "end_ms": 259385,
      "text": "日本人想占站不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00092",
      "start_ms": 259660,
      "end_ms": 261485,
      "text": "中国人想炸炸不垮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00093",
      "start_ms": 262310,
      "end_ms": 263875,
      "text": "战火烧了十几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00094",
      "start_ms": 264130,
      "end_ms": 266535,
      "text": "他依然横跨在钱塘江上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00095",
      "start_ms": 267370,
      "end_ms": 268925,
      "text": "这就是中国桥的骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00096",
      "start_ms": 269500,
      "end_ms": 273515,
      "text": "而这一切的起点是那个叫毛以生的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00097",
      "start_ms": 274420,
      "end_ms": 278385,
      "text": "他造桥的时候没想过这座桥会经历这么多磨难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00098",
      "start_ms": 279360,
      "end_ms": 280115,
      "text": "但他知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00099",
      "start_ms": 280680,
      "end_ms": 282655,
      "text": "这座桥必须结示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00100",
      "start_ms": 283540,
      "end_ms": 286985,
      "text": "因为他承载的不只是火车和汽车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00101",
      "start_ms": 287570,
      "end_ms": 288905,
      "text": "是中国人的骨气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289890,
      "end_ms": 291410,
      "text": "这座桥被炸了四次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291410,
      "end_ms": 295500,
      "text": "还能站起来的故事就写在国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295520,
      "end_ms": 296165,
      "text": "这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00105",
      "start_ms": 296740,
      "end_ms": 298115,
      "text": "书里还有四十多位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00106",
      "start_ms": 298490,
      "end_ms": 301005,
      "text": "像毛以生这样的国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00107",
      "start_ms": 301560,
      "end_ms": 304655,
      "text": "每一个人的故事都比小说还精彩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00108",
      "start_ms": 305190,
      "end_ms": 309765,
      "text": "想要的朋友左下角点链接直接带走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00109",
      "start_ms": 310070,
      "end_ms": 311185,
      "text": "但故事还没完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00110",
      "start_ms": 311720,
      "end_ms": 315715,
      "text": "矛以身许下的此桥必复四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00111",
      "start_ms": 316040,
      "end_ms": 317165,
      "text": "后来兑现了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00112",
      "start_ms": 317780,
      "end_ms": 320765,
      "text": "下一集毛以生系列大结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00113",
      "start_ms": 321040,
      "end_ms": 321705,
      "text": "他回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00114",
      "start_ms": 322200,
      "end_ms": 327615,
      "text": "带着十四箱图纸把这座炸了四次的桥修了回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00115",
      "start_ms": 328070,
      "end_ms": 331545,
      "text": "如果你也为这座桥坚强感到震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00116",
      "start_ms": 331900,
      "end_ms": 333615,
      "text": "点个赞收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1dc5b31f6ce02387_s00117",
      "start_ms": 333930,
      "end_ms": 335465,
      "text": "关注我大结局见。"
    }
  ],
